                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "\"I went into [i]AWAY[/i] not really knowing what to expect. I saw that it had mixed reviews on Steam, but I was charmed by its visual style and decided I was willing to take a punt on it during a sale. As it turns out, my impressions of it are just as mixed as those Steam reviews suggested they might be. It’s not a bad game, but it’s so painfully average and occasionally tedious that sitting down to write this review felt like more of a chore than anything. Its visuals draw inspiration from a visionary, yet [i]AWAY: Journey to the Unexpected[/i] is anything but.\"\n\nFull review [url=https://olivigarden.ca/2026/09/09/away-journey-to-the-unexpected-review/]here[/url]",
